        "title": "The line graph shows the use of renewable energy accounting for total energy from 1971 to 2011. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features and making comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The line graph shows the use of renewable energy accounting for total energy from 1971 to 2011. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features and making comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp;IELTS Writing Task 1 - Renewable Energy Use (1971&ndash;2011)</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYVsdh3adoPqlLxBlWcl4gUVgwd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WzbldxsHvoEmSdxHZSalPqZUg4b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Renewable Energy Use (1971&ndash;2011) y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về tỷ lệ phần trăm năng lượng t&aacute;i tạo trong tổng năng lượng ti&ecirc;u thụ ở s&aacute;u quốc gia (Finland, Denmark, France, Germany, United States, v&agrave; United Kingdom) từ năm 1971 đến 2011.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLFYdUG36o4o85xAOPBlI161gNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><strong> </strong>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UEs9dlyx2okrTPxmScBl9NDNgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề &nbsp;Renewable Energy Use (1971&ndash;2011) với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ phần trăm năng lượng t&aacute;i tạo - s&aacute;u quốc gia - từ năm 1971 đến 2011.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMCAdCHAAo2jQNxu5Fplz84fgmb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BPLHdZ1AWonL9Zx1HAklrflQgAd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrEfdeA32oruHJxpv0CltBnPg7d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FCkCdAPs9oUNGVxxTwhlgylYgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UnG2dXTj8oL2X8xuX3Rlt6d3g6b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Phần lớn c&aacute;c quốc gia (Denmark, France, Germany, United States, v&agrave; United Kingdom) đều c&oacute; xu hướng tăng trong giai đoạn n&agrave;y, với United States ghi nhận mức tăng trưởng mạnh nhất. Finland c&oacute; xu hướng dao động (giảm rồi phục hồi về gần mức ban đầu).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jektdtz6qoRvzfxDwTGl0Vy3g8d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Finland duy tr&igrave; tỷ lệ cao nhất trong hầu hết giai đoạn (bắt đầu cao nhất v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c vẫn cao nhất), trong khi United Kingdom lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; tỷ lệ thấp nhất trong suốt giai đoạn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pi8FdlqEUoy6aGxXSiglpGrIgeh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> United States, Germany, v&agrave; France (Countries with substantial growth)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IrAwd9JxtorDimxNXDOlx9MTgjb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mv4ydageCozWmrxlQq1lediYgyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1971 của ba quốc gia n&agrave;y</strong> (United States bắt đầu thấp nhất ở 2.5%, Germany ở mức 5.1%, v&agrave; France ở mức 8.0%).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZtjIdTLXno4SoPxSdvYlmqRJgjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của United States - quốc gia c&oacute; xu hướng r&otilde; r&agrave;ng nhất</strong> (tăng đều đặn trong suốt giai đoạn, từ 2.5% năm 1971 l&ecirc;n 18.3% năm 2011, tăng gần 16 điểm phần trăm - mức tăng trưởng mạnh nhất).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WAqKdWGlYoOAo0ximCrlWu3ZgE2\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của Germany - c&oacute; pattern phức tạp hơn</strong> (ban đầu giảm xuống mức thấp nhất 3.9% năm 1987, sau đ&oacute; phục hồi mạnh mẽ l&ecirc;n 13.4% v&agrave;o năm 2011).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WAqKdWGlYoOAo0ximCrlWu3ZgE2\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của France - c&oacute; pattern ổn định</strong> (thể hiện xu hướng tăng đều đặn từ 8.0% l&ecirc;n 14.5% trong bốn thập kỷ).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjNPd6TvCoVV5Hxq9TQlhCehgNb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjNPd6TvCoVV5Hxq9TQlhCehgNb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BbzKdPgEyoLpsjx7kYIlQ0Q1g4g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0l8dkGHhoeVf1xdcuPlhdbRgHd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YFozdR2IuosAukxF4wqlDPA0gnh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Finland, Denmark, v&agrave; United Kingdom (Remaining countries)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZFQdbZvYoA2RXxrWTdlYAEJgtc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OakHdjIq4oN7KmxKkddlvVE7gKx\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) &nbsp;<strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1971 của ba quốc gia c&ograve;n lại</strong> (Finland bắt đầu ở mức cao nhất 24.5%, vượt xa Denmark ở 14.8%, trong khi United Kingdom chỉ ở mức 0.7% - thấp nhất).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V4tJdLPfloxVJRxsTf8lJMu0gqe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2)<strong> M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của Finland với điểm thấp nhất v&agrave; số liệu cuối c&ugrave;ng </strong>(dao động đ&aacute;ng kể, giảm xuống mức tối thiểu 16.2% năm 1988, sau đ&oacute; phục hồi l&ecirc;n 23.5% năm 2011, kết th&uacute;c gần bằng mức ban đầu).</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V4tJdLPfloxVJRxsTf8lJMu0gqe\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của Denmark v&agrave; so s&aacute;nh với Finland</strong> (cũng trải qua nhiều dao động nhưng c&oacute; xu hướng tăng tổng thể, kết th&uacute;c ở 17.2% năm 2011).</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V4tJdLPfloxVJRxsTf8lJMu0gqe\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của United Kingdom</strong> (thể hiện mức tăng trưởng khi&ecirc;m tốn nhất nhưng đều đặn nhất, tăng dần từ 0.7% l&ecirc;n 5.9%, mặc d&ugrave; vẫn l&agrave; quốc gia thấp nhất trong suốt giai đoạn).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYRddABRToQrqNxG0fSl7OrOg5c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdvRdtEEMoe1nqxSg4NlhL6GgQf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WIUnd6WAUoXWJSx4xA3lyHevgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GzVudZspKo0jPLxbMunl1LTAgjc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>năng lượng c&oacute; thể t&aacute;i tạo\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"renewable energy use\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể paraphrase th&agrave;nh <strong>\"renewable energy usage\"</strong>, hoặc <strong>\"the share of renewable energy\"</strong>&nbsp;để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TuK9dgT5AoBU6KxgM0plA894gId\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TuK9dgT5AoBU6KxgM0plA894gId\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Renewable energy usage</strong> increased significantly in most countries.</li>\n<li><strong>The share of renewable energy</strong> in the United States grew dramatically.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2728,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The line graph illustrates the proportion of renewable energy consumption relative to total energy use in six countries over a 40-year period from 1971 to 2011.</p>",
            "question_id": 35858,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2729,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the proportion of energy coming from renewable sources increased in most of the six countries over the period, with the United States showing the most marked growth, while Finland was the only nation to experience noticeable fluctuations. In addition, Finland consistently recorded the highest share of renewables, whereas the United Kingdom relied on them the least throughout the years shown.</p>",
            "question_id": 35858,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2730,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Looking at countries with significant growth, in 1971, the United States began with the second-lowest figure at 2.5%, which was half that of Germany's approximately 5% and roughly one-third of France's 8%. The US proportion then rose steadily throughout the entire period, reaching just over 18% by 2011, representing an increase of nearly 16 percentage points. Meanwhile, Germany&rsquo;s figures initially fluctuated, declining to a low of under 4% in 1987 before recovering dramatically to roughly 13% in the final year. Similarly, France showed a consistent upward trajectory, rising steadily from 8% to around 14.5% over the four decades.</p>",
            "question_id": 35858,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2731,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
